{"ASK_GROUP","role=prisoner|tmp=predator|st=careful",{"Why, you writing it down?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nobody, I'm- I'm alone right now, I was with a couple of people, and we lost each other at the highway","Just my neighbor and me, Mister Daley, he's up the way, he can't walk fast, so I've been slowing down","My church group, nine of us, we've been staying together since Saturday, we pray a lot","It's me and some folks from work, five of us, we found a place with a lock and a TV that doesn't work","A couple of strangers I met two days ago, we haven't even got each other's last names","M-my family, that's all the group I need, wife, kid, dog, we're a unit!!","It was me and three college roommates... now it's me and one -- I'd rather not say what happened to the others","A bunch of people from the apartment building, we stuck together, we're sort of a floor, a floor of people","I'm with some hunters, we met on the road, and they've been decent, they let me carry the water","Nobody, it's just me, it's always just me, and I'm not usually afraid of that, but I am right now","Oh, God, I'm sorry, a group? I thought you meant- uh, I don't know, a group of me?","We're from the school, we had to leave, there's twelve of us, five are kids, I won't say more!"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Couple dozen of us, we hold a place near here, we have rules, we have a rota, I'm not going to tell you more yet","My crew's mostly folks from the plant, we know each other, we trust each other, that took a while","I'm with nobody, which is its own kind of safe","Just a few of us, we've been together since the first week, we'd die for each other, and some of us did","We don't have a name... we're not that kind of group -- we're just people who keep showing up for each other","We call ourselves the Pike Road bunch, because that's where we met, not very creative, it works...","Me, my sister, and a guy we keep meaning to ask to leave"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=friendly",{"I'd love to introduce you, we're good people, you'd like them, they'd like you, heh","We're a small crew, a friendly one, and you're welcome to say hi, I can put a word in for you","Just my friends -- honestly, you'd get on with them!"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=careful",{"Why do you want to know? I'm not saying","It's nobody you need to meet","Group? what group? I don't know what you're talking about","That's my business, back up","Enough of us to make you regret asking"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=civilian_loner",{"Nobody, I walk alone, it's the only way I've lasted","Me and a dog, and if you've got an opinion about the dog, keep it","Used to run with a couple of guys from the hunting club, one's gone, and the other, well, he's gone differently","Just me, I stay out of other people's way, they stay out of mine","Loose bunch, some fishermen, a farmer, a guy who sells scrap, none of us like each other much, we get along...","I bounce between camps, I don't stay long, nobody asks much and I don't tell","A few old boys from the VFW, we meet when we can, trade rumors, share a bottle, that's the extent of it","Lone wolf, as they say, but a wolf with sore feet and a bad attitude","Used to be four of us, now it's me and the memory of three"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"Alone -- and I intend to STAY that way, so, goodbye","It's my own affair","I don't answer to anyone, and I don't answer to you","Alone"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_man,family_woman",{"My family and a couple of neighbors... eleven in all, six kids, so our ranks are not exactly deadly","Hendersons, Millers and us, three families in one house... you can picture it","Just my wife and the kids... we don't need anybody else -- we're our own group","Family and the church down the road, we're all over each other, but it works","I'm responsible for sixteen people, and I'd like to sleep, please, so you understand why I'm careful","Me and my brothers, five of us, we farm, we always farmed, now we guard","A neighborhood watch, honest-to-God neighborhood watch, we had a meeting last Thursday, it was about a hedge"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_man,family_woman|st=careful",{"Not telling you, and I'm not going to ask AGAIN","You're awfully curious, stranger","My family and I are none of your concern!","My family"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_elder",{"Mostly women and children and one old man with a rifle, that's me, I'm the old man","The sisters from my congregation, six of us, we're older than dirt, but we know how to cook","My neighbors, forty years I've known them, it was nice to finally see them in their robes","We're the old folks and a few kids, we're not much of a group, but we're not a bad one either","Just me, honey, and the Lord, and He doesn't answer much"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_elder|st=careful",{"Don't you worry about who I'm with","I'm with the Lord"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_youth",{"Just me and my buddy Jason, we've been together since the high school got locked down","My cousin, my aunt, and her three little kids, I'm kind of in charge, which is insane, I'm seventeen","My friends from band, there's four of us, we sleep in shifts","I don't have a group, I had a group, and then, I- I can't, sorry","Nobody, I was with my dad, and then I wasn't","My whole class is hiding in the gym, I snuck out to find food, they're counting on me"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_youth|st=careful",{"Nope, not saying","My business!"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=worker",{"Crew from the plant, ten of us, same shift, we found the break room has a lock, it's a good lock","Me and my brother-in-law, who I used to hate, and now I'm glad he's here","Some truckers, a few mechanics, a mailman, we're a mixed bag, but we cover each other","I'm with the guys from the garage, five of us, we've got tools, nobody bothers us, nobody should","Nobody, I do a job, I take my pay, I go home, that was always my way","Just me, I'm a loner by trade, I've worked alone for years, long haul, it suits me","Dock crew, thirty guys, a lot of attitude, I can't tell you where, but it's a good bunch"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=worker|st=careful",{"It's none of your damn business!!","I'm with a lot of big guys -- and you're acting suspicious","My crew"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_medical",{"A few other nurses, a couple of EMTs, we're trying to keep the wounded alive in an old school gym","I'm alone, the rest of my team didn't, they, uh, it's a long story, and not a good one","The clinic staff, six of us, and about twenty patients, it's, uh, a lot","Volunteers from the church and a retired surgeon who is mean as hell and absolutely brilliant","My unit, what's left of it, three of us out of eleven, I can't go further, sorry"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"Not telling, they're sick, they can't defend themselves, and I won't say where!","My group is my patients, and they're sick, and I won't expose them to you"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_clergy",{"My flock, Lord help me, half of them scared stiff and the other half just stubborn","Just me, my dear, and God, and a stray cat with an attitude problem","The parish, thirty families, we've circled our wagons, as they say","A few deacons, two nuns, and my cousin, who has been very unhelpful"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_firefighter",{"The company, what's left, six of us out of fourteen, we sleep at the station, we fight, we eat, we do it again","A few volunteers, some off-duty cops, a nurse, we pulled together, nobody planned it","Me and my partner, Tommy, if he's still alive, and I think he is"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=militia",{"Local people. We try to look after each other. I'd rather keep it that way","Hunting club, twelve guys, wives, kids, we're all in one barn, and nobody gets bored","Some neighbors, and a few guys from the range, we are protecting what's ours, that's all"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"You? you wanna meet 'em? you'd fit right in, you're good folks, I'll introduce you personally","Friends of mine, great people, and you've done right by us, so you've earned a seat","I'd trust you with anybody I know, so yeah, come see my group","I'd love for you to meet them, they've heard about you, they'll love you","My people are your people -- if you want us to be!","We're a good bunch, you'd fit right in, honest!","Come and see, they're all waiting, they know who you are","There's twelve of us, and every one of them would put in a good word for you, heh","We call ourselves a family, though we're not related, you're welcome to join","They're good folks, kind, brave, a little crazy, but good","You'll meet them, and you'll like them, and they'll like you, I just know it","We look out for each other, you'd get looked out for too","It's a mix: a nurse, a mechanic, a teacher, a couple of old farmers","They all know you, by reputation, in the good way","Our group's small, but it's strong, and it's open to you","Six of us, and we'd be seven with you","A band of misfits, and you'd be our favorite misfit","We've been together since the start, we'd make room for one more","Friends, mostly, and some family, and now you","Folks from the neighborhood who decided to hang together","You'd like us, we're not too serious, we play cards!!","Good people, the kind you want in your corner","I won't lie, we argue, but we love each other","You'll be glad to know them, and they'll be glad to know you","I've told them all about you, only good things!","We're a patchwork -- but we hold together!","They're nice, they're loud, they're funny, you'll see","We share everything, work, food, stories, you'd fit in","We'd be honored to have you in our company","We're not much, but we're loyal","Everyone here would vouch for you","A lot of good hearts in a few small rooms!"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Not telling you, after what I've heard about you","You've got a reputation, {mister}, and I won't give you my people"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|rep=bad,worst",{"Get away from me, I'm not telling you anything!"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"I don't have a group, I lost them, I lost them all, in the dark, in the running, I called and called","W-who am I with? nobody, nobody, I'm completely alone, and it's the worst thing!!","A few of us... in a cellar, we hold hands, we don't speak, we just breathe together","Some neighbors, we shush each other, we hide together, we cry together, quietly"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|mood=grim",{"The group's smaller than yesterday, and bigger than tomorrow, if you see what I mean","We're the ones who stayed, who didn't run, who didn't turn, who didn't give up","Nine souls -- one tarp, two guns, and a promise to bury whoever goes first"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I used to be with eleven people... now it's three... I count them every night","My group... my family... there's only me now, and the memory of their voices","We lost Danny yesterday... he was the youngest... we keep saying his name"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Good people, mostly, and idiots, stubborn as mules... I'd die for 'em and I'd strangle 'em too","A bunch of cowards, if I'm honest, but they're MY cowards, and I won't hear a word against them","We used to be bigger, until the last wave of lunatics ran off with half our stuff"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"My people! my wonderful, odd, loving people, you'd love them, they'd love you","We're a family, not by blood, by choice, and I wouldn't trade them for anything"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"A group of idiots, led by a bigger idiot, that's us, we're thriving","We call ourselves \"the survivors,\" but it's more like \"the lucky ones with bad knees\"","A group of people who can't agree on anything","A bunch of cranky old folks and one very patient teenager"},false,false,{[3]={{t="which is why we're still alive",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|mood=fear",{"Who I'm with ain't your business!","W-why? you counting heads?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Mostly patients, thirty or so... four staff, two nurses, an orderly and a retired surgeon","A makeshift clinic, a dozen volunteers, church ladies, a vet, a pharmacist, it holds","I'm with the sick and the scared, which is, if you think about it, everyone","{faction}, we run the aid station - nobody works for anybody, we just show up"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|hour=4,11",{"They're waiting to meet you, they asked about you just this morning"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"None of your business who I'm with","I'd never introduce them to you","They'd run if they saw you","You'd be the last person I'd let near them!","Don't ask, I'm not telling","They're good people, and you're not","I keep them away from the likes of you!","That's none of your concern!","Stay away from my people","They'd tear you apart, and I'd let them","You're not on the guest list","If you come near them -- you'll regret it","They know about you, and they don't like it","Who am I with? Anyone but you","You'd best NOT find out!!","Don't you dare ask about them","Why do you want to know? so you can hurt them?","Not a word -- not a hint, not a clue","I'll keep my people, you keep your distance","They'd rather not meet you","Keep walking","I won't give you names","Mind your own group","They're better off without you","I'm with people who have good judgment","My crew is not your crew","You're not welcome among them","No introductions, ever!","I won't invite trouble!","It's not for you to know","I'm not inviting you any closer"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Group? we're hiding... we're all hiding, shh!!","I'm with people who are waiting for me, and I'm not home, because THEY are in the way","Don't ask, I can't say, they could be listening","I'm with a bunch of scared folks, right now, I should be with them","Later -- please, later, I'm busy not dying!"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"My group could use someone like you, with that","We have rules about weapons, so, you'd have to talk to our leader"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"There's six of us, and a dog","My sister and I, and her husband, and his mother, and a stray cat...","We started with twelve","Just me and my boy","A few folks from the church","Two nurses, an old farmer, and a kid","I'm alone","My coworkers","My family, and some neighbors...","A few boys from my hunting club"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the dog's the only one who never complains",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="it's a lot of personalities",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="we have eight",afterMs=3500},{t="we say the other four's names at dinner",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="he's nine",afterMs=3200},{t="he asks a lot of questions",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="we pray, and we cook, and we argue about the cooking",afterMs=3500}},[6]={{t="you'd think it was the start of a joke",afterMs=3200}},[7]={{t="I was with a group",afterMs=3500},{t="not any more",afterMs=3000}},[8]={{t="we spent years complaining about each other",afterMs=3200},{t="now we'd die for each other",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="we've got a system",afterMs=3500},{t="nobody likes it, but it works",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="we all know how to shoot...",afterMs=3200},{t="we all know how to stay quiet",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I'd like you to meet them!"},false,false,{[1]={{t="they'd like you",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"I'm not telling a stranger","Why?","I'm with people","That's none of your concern, and the answer's no","You think I'd say?","I'm not alone -- if that's what you're wondering","My group? Not something I discuss with strangers","Enough people to deal with you","Why do you want to know who I'm with? So you know how many to shoot?"},false,{[9]="GENERIC"},{[2]={{t="are you trying to count us?",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="people who'd hurt you",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="with you listening?",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"Me","A couple of old boys I trade with","Nobody"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and the dog, and a goat sometimes",afterMs=3200}},[2]={{t="we don't talk much, we just nod",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="and that's how it'll stay",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"The church ladies and me, dear, we look after each other","I'm with my neighbor, Eunice"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and the cat",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="we bicker like sisters, which we're not",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm with my cousin and her baby","My friends, mostly"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and a guy named Dale who knows stuff",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="we're like, a band, but we don't have instruments",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Crew from the plant, eleven of us","Me and two guys I used to eat lunch with"},false,false,{[1]={{t="same shift, same break room, same bad jokes",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="we don't talk much, we work",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"My family, my wife's family, and the neighbors","Just us... the five of us"},false,false,{[1]={{t="nineteen, all told",afterMs=3500},{t="four generations",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="that's plenty to worry about",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"My flock, what's left..","A few deacons, a few widows, and the choir director who won't leave"},false,false,{[1]={{t="forty on a good Sunday, twelve on a bad",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"The congregation"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"The company","Fire department, three stations merged into one, because two of them burned - I know"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and a handful of volunteers",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful",{"The station!"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"The watch","Local militia.."},false,false,{[1]={{t="six men, rotating",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="guys from the range, guys from the lodge",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Who am I with? A better crew than whatever you've got","My people, the ones who eat first, want a seat?","I run with folks who'd shoot you for that question, and I'm feeling generous","You don't need a name. You can ask what you want without it","I'm not giving you names. Ask what you came to ask, and leave other people out of it","I work for the biggest outfit in the county, that's all"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Why, you planning on running to them? You wouldn't make it","I'm with the guys who'll find you if you tell a soul, clear?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"We're a crew, good people if you're on the right side, you thinking of joining?","Family, mostly, folks who stuck together, funny word for it, ain't it?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Mine, the whole damn lot of them answer to me"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"My set, my people, ask nicer and maybe I tell","We're a family, you're not in it, yet","The crew I roll with? You're lucky I'm not telling you","We run this side, that's all you need to know"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Mind your business, my crew's none of yours"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Neighborhood boys, loyal as it gets, you looking?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"The club, always the club, the patch tells you","I ride with brothers, real ones, you got any?","Colors don't lie, read 'em"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=club|st=hostile",{"You looking at the patch? Good, now look at my hand"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Club brothers, we take care of our own, might take care of you too"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Associates, let's keep it simple","A firm, I can't tell you more","I'm part of an organization, the details are private"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=crime|st=hostile",{"A group that doesn't like questions from strangers"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"A decent bunch, all things considered, care to be a friend?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm not with anybody, I got out, by myself, I think -- alone, yeah, alone","Fellas I did time with, a few of 'em ain't around anymore","We broke out together, there ain't no \"with\" now, just... us","Nobody, I don't trust a soul, not after the yard"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Why? You a cop? You a guard?!"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"A few guys I shared a cell with, we look out for each other, you're okay"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Nobody you've heard of, a few folks I trust more than a badge","Solo mostly, or whoever's willing","I run with a couple of guys, they watch my back, I watch theirs"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw|st=hostile",{"Doesn't concern you, walk"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Whoever lets me stay, why, you looking for company?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Nobody, I left the unit, I can't talk about it"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"County sheriff's department, what's the interest?","Highway patrol, that clear it up?","Officers like me, people trying to keep it together"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=law|st=hostile",{"What group I'm with is not your concern, answer MY question first"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Fellow deputies, mostly, good people, want to meet them?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"This office, and everyone who still answers to it"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=law_trooper|st=neutral,careful",{"State Police, what's left of Post Seven"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=law_corrections|st=neutral,careful",{"What's left of the correctional staff, not many"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=swat|st=neutral,careful",{"Special response, I can't elaborate"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Third Armored, or what's left of it","Quarantine detail, we're not at liberty to say more","Army, same as you'd expect"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military|st=hostile",{"That's classified, say what you want or move on"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Fine soldiers, all of them, we're trying to help folks where we can"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"My squad, every one of them better than you'd expect"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Uh, we're-- we're a unit, I just got here, it's, um, loud, I don't know most of them"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"Unaffiliated, don't ask again"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Whoever pays, currently nobody","A private outfit, we don't discuss clients"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Local militia, neighbors who decided not to wait for rescue","Township watch, a bunch of farmers, mostly, we're better than we look"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=militia|st=hostile",{"We're the ones who decide who gets through, now who are you with?"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Good neighbors, all of them, you're welcome to meet them"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"County personnel, that's all","Who I'm with is the badge, who you're with is my concern"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military,elite|st=careful",{"Need-to-know only"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Friends of mine, who don't like questions"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Us? We're just regular people, neighbors, mostly, we found each other on the way","We're a few families who stuck together, nobody's in charge, we just keep each other alive","It's me and my brother and a lady we met on the road, that's our whole group","We don't have a name, we're just... not alone, which is something","Just friends, some friends and some friends of friends, we get along okay"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=careful,neutral",{"Why do you want to know? Why? Who are you with?","We're a big group, a BIG group, lots of us, armed, so don't try anything"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Eight of us, give or take, depending on who's still breathing","A bunch of survivors, no flags, no names, just folks who got lucky","Mixed bag, couple vets, a nurse, two kids, and we manage","Ragtag bunch, mostly honest, mostly fed"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"Who wants to know? Who are YOU with?","Enough to take care of anyone who bothers us"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"We're a family, dear, three generations, thank the Lord we're all still together","Just us, my husband, my daughter, her little ones, and the dog"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"County deputies, what's left of us, we're holding what we can","Sheriff's office, we're working with whoever shows up and needs help"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=law,swat|st=careful,neutral",{"That's classified, state your own business first"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Guard remnants, we're holding position, we protect who we can","Army, what's left, and we answer to a chain of command"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military,elite|st=careful,neutral",{"That information is restricted"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"We run this stretch, you ask a lot of questions","We're friends, family, whatever you want to call it, we look out for each other"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Ask again and you'll find out the hard way"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Can't help you with that one, it's not for outsiders"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Why, so you can come back with friends? Get away from us!","Nobody you want to meet, now step off"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=law,swat|st=hostile",{"We're the law, you're the problem","You are with nobody right now - get on the ground"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military,elite|st=hostile",{"Authorized personnel only"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"We're the ones who'll bury you"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"We're not a group, really, just us and the Hendersons from next door, we just ended up together"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"With? I'm not with anybody - should I be? Is that what people are doing now?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Just my family, my husband, me, the two girls - and the dog, if he comes back"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=family_man|st=friendly,neutral",{"My wife, my boy, and the baby, that's all the group I got, and it's plenty to worry about"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=fence",{"{group}, we don't have a fancy name, we have a well and a fence"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=neutral",{"{faction}, decent people, mostly, we keep a list of the ones who aren't"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly",{"{group}, there's room at the table if you're handy with a hammer - you want in?"},false,{[1]="JOIN_GROUP"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"{faction}, we watch the roads so the families can sleep"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"{group}, bunch of us from the shop - Welders, a plumber, and one guy who swears he's an electrician"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|world=window",{"My flock, what's left of it, we meet in the fellowship hall now - the sanctuary has too many windows"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=law_deputy,law_sheriff|st=friendly,neutral",{"Knox County Sheriff's Office - well, some of it, the ones who stayed"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=law_trooper|st=friendly,neutral",{"Kentucky State Police, last contact with command was Sunday, I'm still with them"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=law_officer,law_sergeant|st=friendly,neutral",{"Police department, we're working alongside {faction} till somebody tells us different"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"County tactical team, attached to {faction} for now"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Army - quarantine detail, unit's not for public knowledge, but we're the ones in green"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"US Army, battalion's scattered from here to Fort Knox - I'm with whoever's standing next to me"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Army, uh, I don't actually know which platoon anymore - they merged us twice"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"US Army, that is all the information you are cleared for"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Tasked unit - that's enough"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=elite|st=careful,hostile",{"Classified - move along"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"I travel with {group} - quiet folks, we trade and we don't ask"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=deserter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Used to be the Army, now I'm with {group}, and they don't ask for my service number"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=outlaw|st=careful,hostile",{"Nobody you'll ever find, let's keep it that way"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"{faction} - you heard of us? You will"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=raider_boss|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"This is {faction}, I built it out of drunks and bad decisions, and it runs better than the county did"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"{group}, we run this side of town - look at the walls, we sign our work"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"The club, that's all you need to say around here, everybody knows which one"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=biker_boss|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"{faction}, twenty-two years on these roads, the end of the world is just another run"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Us? The graduating class, early release program, courtesy of the power going out"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=careful",{"Who we're with ain't your business, who you're with is - talk"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=hostile",{"{faction}, and you just walked into our part of the county - bad day for you"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"An organization, a family business, you could say - not your family"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=crime|st=careful,hostile",{"People who ask who we work for usually work for somebody - who do you work for?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=neutral|mood=sad",{"Group? There's me, there used to be six of us in a house on {street}"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral,friendly",{"We don't have a name, fella tried to give us one and we laughed at him"}},
{"ASK_GROUP","role=law_sergeant|st=neutral",{"Whatever's left of the department, that's four people and one working radio"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Guns? I don't know, I never bought one, my husband did, I don't know where","There was a shop out by the highway, but it's been cleaned out, I heard, THERE's nothing left!","Pawn shops, maybe, but everyone's been through, I'd think twice","I don't want to know about guns, I just want it to STOP","Hunting store... I think -- on the main road, the one with the bear in the window"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Gun shops were the first to go, hit in the first two days, picked clean","Try the pawn shops, the hardware stores, the sporting goods, one of them might have a stash","Most people kept their guns at home, so houses are your best bet","Old men's closets, old men's sheds, old men's gun safes, that's where they are","Ask around, someone always knows someone with a few hunting rifles"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I know a man who might help, if you're careful, and if you're honest!"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why do you want a gun?","Not telling you"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=civilian_loner",{"Gun shops are full of ghosts, but a good hunting lodge still has a rack or two"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=militia",{"Armory's sealed, don't try, the sheriff's keeping the rest"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Gun store? Gone, {g:pal|lady}, cleaned out on day one, I got there too late, and I'm still angry about it","Every gun store in the county got hit in the first hour, even the pawn shops","You think I'd tell you? I'd rather you stay unarmed, thanks","The shops are empty, but there's a hunting lodge, back road, owner kept a stash, last I heard","Guns? Take 'em off the dead, it's free and they won't be needing 'em"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You want guns? I've got one right here, want to meet it?"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? There was a pawn shop on Main, cleaned out, but the back room had boxes of shells, maybe still"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Guns? Man, those shelves got stripped faster than a Black Friday sale","Cops took the rest, from every shop they could find","You need a gun, you earn it, you don't buy it"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Nobody's selling, nobody's giving, so move on"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I know a guy with a basement full of pistols, but he's picky about who he talks to"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Gun shops were the first thing looted, {g:brother|sister}, even before the groceries","There's a sporting goods place off the highway, probably empty, but you can check","Pawn shops sometimes have a few left, under the counter"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Don't ask me about guns, {g:brother|sister}, I'm particular about who I tell"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I know a guy who sells, not cheap, but fair, I'll make an introduction"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Guns, yeah, I know a guy who knows a guy, it'll cost you","I know of a source, but access is not for sale to strangers","Every shop's been cleaned out, the stockroom stuff is another story"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"If you're serious, we can arrange a meeting"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Guns? No, no, I stay away from guns, they'll know I have one, they'll come","I don't know, I don't want to know, please don't ask me"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Stop asking about guns! Stop it!"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"There was a shop, burned down, maybe there's something in the ashes"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Stores are all picked clean, check the farmhouses, folks keep rifles in the closet","Old hunters kept shotguns above the mantle, find the right house and you're set","Pawn shop on the county road, the back safe, if it's still locked"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"I have a spare rifle in my camp, I might trade it for something good"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Civilians are not authorized to acquire firearms at this time","The gun shops were secured by the department, but many were looted","Sporting goods stores were hit hard, I wouldn't waste time on them"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Looting a gun store is a felony, even now"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"If you need protection, come with us to the courthouse"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Weapons are controlled, civilians may not be armed","Retail outlets have been secured, or raided, depending on the location"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Stay away from weapons stores, they are off limits"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I'd advise you to stay with a group, they're safer"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I only know about the armory, but it's guarded, and I'm not supposed to say"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Everybody in these parts has a gun, so you won't find a shop, you'll find a neighbor","Hardware store in town has some, maybe, but the owner's touchy"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Come by the farm, we'll talk about what you need"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't have a gun shop location I can verify for you"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","st=careful",{"Why are you asking me where to arm yourself?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","st=hostile",{"I'm not helping you find something to point at me"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=neutral,friendly",{"I used to drive past those places without even looking - wish I'd paid attention now"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=law,swat|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm not directing an unknown person toward weapons"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=military,elite|st=neutral,careful",{"No verified stock, no verified security - that's all I've got"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=rescue|st=neutral,friendly",{"Owning a gun and knowing what to do with it aren't the same problem"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=worker|st=neutral",{"A sign over a shop doesn't mean there's anything left behind the counter"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=club,outlaw,prison|st=neutral,careful",{"People will fight over an empty box if the label says ammunition"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=crime,gang,raider|st=careful,hostile",{"You're asking that question louder than I'd recommend"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Try a pawn shop, nobody thinks pawn, and half of 'em had a rack behind the counter"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly|world=door,building",{"Every farmhouse round here's got a .22 behind the kitchen door - ask first, though"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Feed store carried shells - birdshot mostly, better than nothing, worse than you want"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Deer camps, a hunter leaves a box of .30-30 in a cabin and forgets it till November"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly|world=door",{"I won't help you find a gun, I'll help you find a door that locks, that's my trade"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sporting goods got emptied first, the reloading shelf got left, powder, primers, brass"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=family_elder|st=friendly",{"Papaw's 12 gauge is behind the water heater, you take it, you take care of it"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=civilian_woman,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Look under beds - Daddy kept his under the bed his whole life and never told Mama"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"Our armory got emptied on the seventh, we signed for every one of 'em, too"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"I'm not sending a civilian to a gun shop, I'll say the lock shops got hit worse"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Anything military is accounted for, your best bet is a man's closet, not a store"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral|world=vehicle",{"They took our ammo cans off the truck and left us the empties - real helpful"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"A gun without the right ammunition is a club - ask about the ammunition first"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=club|st=neutral",{"Shops are picked - try the flea market building, they had a table every Saturday"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"I know a fella who knows a fella, that's two favors deep and you ain't got one"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=mercenary|st=neutral|world=vehicle",{"I'd sell you a pistol, price is a running vehicle, and I'm not joking"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Hardware stores kept shells in the back by the bug spray - look behind the counter"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral",{"I don't do guns, I do what guns make - ask somebody who enjoys the first half"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"I don't want to talk guns with a stranger - no offense - well - some offense"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"If I knew a stocked shop, why would I be out here with a single-shot .410?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=law_trooper|st=careful",{"Not a chance, I've taken three guns off folks this week, all three pointed at me"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=swat|st=careful",{"Negative, I don't arm strangers and I don't map armories for them"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=deserter|st=careful",{"I've got what I walked off with - don't ask me for a round of it, either"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=militia|st=careful",{"We've got guns, that's exactly why we don't tell people where the guns are"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|world=building",{"There's a rifle in this house and I don't know how to load it - that's my answer"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=raider|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Want a gun? Here's a gun, I'm holding it, real close to you, ain't it"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Everybody wants a piece, nobody says what they plan on doing with it"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","role=raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"I'll tell you where the guns are, they're on my people - thirty feet that way"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"A man asks another man where to get a gun, he's already decided something"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=hostile",{"No! I'm not telling you that! Have you lost your mind?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_GUN_STORE","reg=civilian,worker,family|tmp=seasoned|st=hostile",{"Ask me about water, ask me about shade, not that"}},
{"ASK_HARVEST","",{"Not much, whatever grows, we eat","A garden here and there - not enough","It's a hope, hope grows slow"}},
{"ASK_HARVEST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"We've got tomatoes, beans, a few squash","The corn's coming along"},false,false,{[1]={{t="it's not much -- but it's ours",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="the deer are eyeing it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HARVEST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why, you planning on stealing it?"}},
{"ASK_HEAT","",{"Hot - and humid - and hot","It's a sauna with the lid off","I haven't been dry in two days"}},
{"ASK_HEAT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's brutal","Drink water, find shade..."},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'm sweating through my socks",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="don't be a hero",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HEAT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"It's hot -- so what!"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"YES! I saw one! it flew right over, low, I waved, I screamed, I jumped, it just kept going","T-there was one, two days ago, high up, a news chopper or the Army, I couldn't tell, I was crying too hard","I heard it, but I couldn't see it, a roar, a flash, and then nothing, it didn't land, and it didn't come back","It didn't even slow down, they must've seen us, they MUST have seen us","We built a signal out of sheets -- but nobody saw it, or nobody cared","I keep waiting for the sound, every minute, I hear rotors in my head!","T-there was one last night, a spotlight sweeping the field, I hid, because I didn't know whose it was"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ha, helicopters... they flew the first week, then nothing, maybe they ran out of fuel","Saw one go down, smoke, fire, the whole thing, nobody got out, or if they did, they didn't live long","It was a medevac, I think, headed for Louisville, never came back","Every once in a while I hear one far away, and it's like hearing a ghost","Haven't seen one in days, I stopped looking up"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? you got a signal flare? no? then why do you care?","I don't talk about aircraft","If you're following that helicopter you're leading them straight to me - go on, keep going","That thing's been circling all morning and it drags a crowd behind it, so quiet"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=militia",{"Choppers are Guard birds, they ran sorties the first two days, and then fuel got tight, now it's just a rumor","Last bird I saw was a Black Hawk, flying a grid, low, never landed once"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=rescue_medical",{"A medevac chopper landed at the clinic on day one, took the critical patients, and never returned"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=civilian_loner",{"Saw one from the ridge -- flying toward the base, nothing since"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"They flew over yesterday, so they know, they KNOW, they'll be back","I saw three on Friday"},false,false,{[2]={{t="I keep scanning the sky",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"Haven't seen one in days","One went over at dawn... high, going north"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I miss the noise",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="I'm still looking up",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"I stopped looking up a long time ago","Haven't heard one in weeks"},false,false,{[2]={{t="I'd cry if I did",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Yeah, I saw it, flew over like it owned the sky, didn't even slow down","They fly over, they look, they leave, nobody up there gives a shit about us","Scared the hell out of me, I thought they were coming for me, then I remembered I don't care","Saw two heading north, nobody waved at them, nobody's that stupid","I took a couple of shots at one, never hit it, it didn't even slow down, that's how little they care","Helicopters mean somebody's still watching, which means I'm still being careful","Black one, no markings, low over the treeline, I stayed real still until it was gone"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Why, you gonna wave at it? It won't help, I promise!","Not a word about the helicopters, I don't want anybody looking up"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I screamed my lungs out when it flew over, it looked right at me and kept going... I cried, okay? I cried","I keep hoping it'll come back, you know? Just once, just one that lands"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Those birds are looking for something, and it isn't us, so I stay out of their way"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"They keep circling, but they don't land, they don't do nothing","Whole block ran out to wave, helicopter didn't even slow down, I wanted to throw a brick at it","Helicopter flew over the projects on day two, shined a light, then left, and we never heard from anybody again","Spotlight swept right over me, I hid in the stairwell like a punk, I'm not proud"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Helicopters don't care about us, so why should I care about them?"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I keep hoping they'll drop supplies, you know? Food, water, anything"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Black ones, no markings, flew low over the highway, scouting for something","Heard rotors all night, couldn't sleep, couldn't tell what they were doing","Medevac chopper went down north of here, smoke for hours, nobody went to help","Two Hueys sat on the ridge for an hour, then peeled off, whatever they were looking for, they found it or gave up"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Ain't nobody coming for you, forget it"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I want one to land so bad, I'd kiss the pilot"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Surveillance, most likely, they are gathering information","I wouldn't signal to them if I were you, you don't know who's inside","Expensive way to look at a problem and not solve it","Whoever's flying those has orders, and I doubt rescuing us is in them"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"It gives me hope, to be honest"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"They flew over the prison the first night, lights on, then gone, never came back","I hide when I hear them, I don't want anyone seeing me and calling it in","Every time one passes I think, this is it, they found me, and every time it keeps going"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Stop talking about them, they might hear!"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I just want one to land and take me away from all this, I don't even care where"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Seen 'em, flying a grid, like they're looking for something specific","I wouldn't count on a helicopter coming to get you. If somebody's promised you a ride, make damn sure you know who","If you hear one, don't stand out waving at it. I wouldn't trust it to be there for us","They're scanning for heat, I figure, so I hide in the cold dirt"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"It's something, at least, proof that someone's out there"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Those aren't looking for survivors, believe me, they're looking for people like me"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"National Guard helicopters on reconnaissance, no landing orders that I know of","We tried signaling with a mirror, nothing","We called them on the radio, they never answered, whoever's up there isn't talking"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Shut it about that, you'll bring the dead down on us"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=law|st=friendly",{"I keep hoping one will land with supplies, honestly"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"They've been over every day, I've radioed them, nobody answers"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Aircraft are conducting aerial survey","That's not something I'm cleared to discuss","They're not here for civilians, I wish they were"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Do not signal the aircraft, that is an order"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I'd love to wave at them too, honestly"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Reconnaissance, nothing to do with you"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"They don't tell us where they're going, I wish they did"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"You didn't see anything up there"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Choppers are expensive, they don't waste fuel on civilians"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Saw one come down low over the fields, looked us over, kept going","Birds go over every morning and nobody ever lands","Kids run out to wave and I have to pull them back inside, it's breaking my heart"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=militia|st=friendly",{"We pray every time we hear them that this will be the one that lands"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"It flew so low over the house the dishes rattled - I ran out waving a dish towel, it didn't even slow down"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=trees",{"You saw it too? I thought it was coming for us - then they all came out of the tree line after it"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,9",{"It has to be rescue - why else fly over? They're looking for people, right? Right?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=5,9999",{"Every time I hear one now I hide - isn't that backwards? I used to run out in the yard to wave"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker|st=friendly,neutral|day=8,9999|hour=4,11|world=water",{"Heard one again this morning, way off toward the river - nobody runs toward that sound anymore"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"That chopper circles and every dead thing for two miles follows it like a parade - don't be under it","Helicopter's the worst noise in the county, worse than gunfire - gunfire stops"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"They're counting us from up there, or looking for something - either way, they ain't landing"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Go chase it, then, take the crowd with you when you go"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=worker,civilian|st=friendly,neutral",{"Big green one set down in the school lot in March Ridge on Saturday - loaded up some folks in suits, left the rest of us standing there"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sounded like a Huey, my daddy flew in those in Vietnam - he'd have known what they were up to"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical,rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"They weren't medevac, I know medevac - no markings, no crosses, and nobody answering on our frequency"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"I rang the church bell when it passed so it would see us - God forgive me, it brought the wrong crowd to the door"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Our air unit's been grounded since day two, that's not ours, and it's not answering on any band I've got"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"It keeps making passes over Muldraugh, low and slow, my guess is recon, recon for what, I couldn't tell you"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"Don't wave at it, don't follow it, and step back from me"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=military|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"That's surveillance, it isn't looking for you, and it isn't landing for you"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral|day=7,9999",{"We had birds on station the first week, now it's one that comes and goes - nobody tells me which"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=military|role=soldier_green|st=friendly,neutral",{"I asked the Sergeant about it and he said eyes front - so I honestly don't know"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=elite",{"It's not ours - don't signal it"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"Stop tracking air traffic and start tracking your feet, headed away from here"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=outlaw,raider,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Every time that bird goes over, the dead line up behind it - best time there is to hit a pharmacy"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"First thing I thought was that helicopter's out looking for us - old habit from inside, turns out it's looking for nobody"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=gang,club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Took a shot at it with a deer rifle, didn't hit nothing, felt good, though"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Helicopter's gone, we're still here - think about that"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Nobody up there is gonna see what happens to you down here"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=raider,club,gang|st=careful,hostile",{"Ask the helicopter for help, then, go on, wave your arms - we'll wait"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"One came over low on the seventh - everybody waved, it just kept on going"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=family|st=neutral|mood=sad|world=building,rooftop",{"We put a bedsheet on the roof with HELP on it - bird's been over twice since"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=water",{"They fly the river line, same pattern, morning and evening - somebody's counting"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral",{"That's a medevac bird, or it was - I've not seen one land in over a week"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=rescue_clergy|st=neutral|mood=sad",{"The sound gets everybody's hopes up, then it goes and they're worse than before"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"State police had one, they grounded it on the eighth, fuel, they said"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Aviation's committed elsewhere - don't stand in the open waving, it won't land"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"They fly over us and don't answer, our radios are the same brand as theirs, too"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"A bird comes low over you, somebody's looking at you - decide how you feel on that"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=deserter|st=careful",{"Don't signal one, they ain't looking for folks to save - they're looking for movement"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","role=civilian_loner|st=careful|mood=grim",{"Same bird, same time, four days running, I quit going outside at five o'clock"}},
{"ASK_HELICOPTER","reg=raider,gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile|mood=funny",{"They fly, we wave, nothing happens, closest thing to church we've got now"}},
}
